# title: Reverse cliquet
# category: Cliquets
# underlyings: 1
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: A 40% coupon from which every negative monthly return is subtracted, floored at zero: the investor sells downside volatility.
#
# Notional 1000, capital protected. Coupon at maturity:
# max(40% + sum of the negative monthly returns, 0).

2027-01-04
    ref = spot()
    losses = 0

schedule(2027-02-04, 2027-12-04, 1M, US, F)
    losses = losses + min(spot() / ref - 1, 0)
    ref = spot()

2028-01-04
    losses = losses + min(spot() / ref - 1, 0)
    pays 1000 * (1 + max(0.40 + losses, 0))
